 "originality_note": "All melody, harmony and patterns were written for this film. The theme is built only from its own motif cells (a three-eighth pickup into a long meend note; the D-C-B Khamaj sigh; a rise to the sixth degree) and is not based on, quoted from or paraphrased from any existing film or wedding song. The progressions change with each scene (no repeating four-chord loop), and the finale is a re-composition in a new key rather than a copy-paste."
